0":{"text":"저 제사장일 것 같아요!","source_cn":"就是这位祭司吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4536CC318B7C05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234460.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423446001:1":{"text":"혹시 평민을 도와주러 온 제사장인가요? 사리에가 무슨 도움이 필요한지 알아보라고 해서 왔어요!","source_cn":"你就是那位想要救助平民的祭司吗？沙利叶让我们来问问你有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1153723E1DC04801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423446002:1":{"text":"마침 잘 오셨어요! 제 지갑이 사라졌거든요... 그건 평민 지역 아이들이 먹을 음식을 사려고 모은 돈이에요!","source_cn":"你们来得正好！我的钱袋不见了……那是我给平民区孩子们买...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F4E25810227A26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423446003:1":{"text":"지갑 좀 찾아 주시겠어요? 가방이 지저분하긴 한데, 신경쓰지 마세요...","source_cn":"能帮我找找我的钱袋吗？包里有点乱，请不要介意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB948841748DC943F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234470.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423447001:0":{"text":"지갑을 찾아주셔서 고맙습니다!","source_cn":"谢谢你们帮我找到钱袋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C71D9373615C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423447002:0":{"text":"아이들이 먹을 걸 사러 가요!","source_cn":"我们去给孩子们买点吃的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB586684E82D09BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234480.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234480","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423448001:1":{"text":"아이들이 좋아할 음식을 사고 싶은데요... 이 돈으로 살 수 있는 만큼 다 주세요!","source_cn":"我想买点孩子们爱吃的食物……这些钱能买多少我就买多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA799C0932FF7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423448002:1":{"text":"쯧쯧, 이 돈으로는 많이 못 사요. 기껏해야 빵 두 개나 사겠네요.","source_cn":"啧啧，恕我直言，您这些钱可买不了多少，顶多只能买两块面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE14410FC8C90B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423448003:1":{"text":"세상이 예전 같지 않아서, 지금 왕성에 값이 안 뛴 물건이 없으니까요!","source_cn":"世道不比以前了，现在王城里什么东西的价格不是飞涨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7008FEF05976EF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423448004:1":{"text":"하지만 두 개로는 턱없이 부족한데... 아이들이 굉장히 많아서요...","source_cn":"可是两块根本不够……那么多孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47708CF89BA5723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423448005:1":{"text":"깊은바위 마을의 빵은 이것보다 크고 맛있었던 것 같아요. 가격도 훨씬 저렴하고요...","source_cn":"我记得深岩村出产的面包个头又大又美味，比这里要实惠得多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E75AE7E47944842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423448006:1":{"text":"제사장님! 저희가 깊은바위 마을에 가서 물어볼게요! 거기 빵이 조금 더 쌀 테니까요!","source_cn":"祭司小姐，我们可以帮你去深岩村问问！那里的面包应该会便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3E9ACDBE3F1BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423448007:1":{"text":"고맙습니다! 지갑은 여러분에게 맡길 테니 되도록이면 빵을 많이 사서 와주세요!","source_cn":"谢谢你们！钱袋就交给你们了，多带些面包回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD454DF30A6F1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:精明的食品商人":{"text":"눈치 빠른 식료품 상인","source":"精明的食品商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234490.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234490","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423449001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요. 빵을 사고 싶은데... 이 돈이면 몇 개나 살 수 있어요?","source_cn":"您好，我们想买些面包……这些钱够买多少呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA869D48371C5B137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423449002:1":{"text":"어휴, 이 돈이면 여기 있는 빵 전부 다 사갈 수 있겠는데! 손이 크군!","source_cn":"这！这都够把我手头的面包都买下来了！大主顾啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0610FB5F2FF46CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423449003:1":{"text":"바로 포장해 줄게. 다음 번에 또 오라고!","source_cn":"我给您把面包装起来，欢迎您下次再来！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFC206EA953CC0F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"바로 포장해 줄게. 다음 번에 또 오라고!","female":"바로 포장해 줄게. 다음 번에 또 오라고!","variant_male_record_index":"171961","variant_female_record_index":"171962","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:矮人巴尔姆":{"text":"드워프 바룸","source":"矮人巴尔姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234500.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234500","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234500","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423450001:1":{"text":"와! 빵을 이렇게 많이 가져오시다니. 아이들이 배불리 먹을 수 있을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"哇！你们带回了这么多面包！孩子们能吃顿饱饭了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF260CC8A16E1DF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423450002:1":{"text":"어서 아이들에게 빵을 가져다 주러 가요!","source_cn":"我们去把面包带给孩子们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3920EB9ACE1C46E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234510.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234510","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423451001:1":{"text":"언니, 이게 뭐예요? 좋은 냄새가 나요... 달콤해...","source_cn":"姐姐，这是什么……闻起来很香，很甜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65CB2EFB0A98AD27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423451002:1":{"text":"이건 빵이라는 거예요. 모두에게 주는 거니까 천천히 먹어요.","source_cn":"这叫面包！是给你的，慢慢吃吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB5DEB9F75020A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瑟缩的平民小孩":{"text":"움츠러든 평민 아이","source":"瑟缩的平民小孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234520.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234520","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423452001:1":{"text":"빵 좀 먹어요. 그러면 힘이 날 거예요!","source_cn":"吃点面包吧！这样才会有力气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA462878AAD3067DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423452002:1":{"text":"고맙습니다... 여러분은 엄마가 하늘에서 보내주신 분들인가요...","source_cn":"谢谢你们……你们一定是妈妈从天上召唤来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E33CE474AB15A1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:饥饿的平民小孩":{"text":"배고픈 평민 아이","source":"饥饿的平民小孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14234530.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234530","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234530","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423453001:1":{"text":"이거... 저 주시는 건가요... 가져가도 안 때리실 거죠...","source_cn":"这是……给我的吗……拿了